{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>For the priests</b> adjoins the section of the king, for by the hand of the High Priest the king is anointed, and Scripture placed king first because he is greater than him (the priest). And a further hint: <i>upon the prince</i> shall be the olah, the minhah, and the nesakh — and likewise just as priest and Levite receive tithe, so the king tithes your flocks:" "<b>YHWH's fire-offerings and his inheritance</b>, and written after it: <i>And this shall be the priests' due</i> — for priests acquire from the Table on High:" "<b>The Levites</b> in gematria: אדנ\"י הוי\"ה — and this is: <i>YHWH is his inheritance</i>."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:59.317020355Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}